{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dash through levels at the speed of Pi, but watch out! You only have 3.14 seconds to beat each level!</strong> Easy as Pi is a difficult and fast paced speed running game where skill and optimization is rewarded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536140/extras/piBlocks.png?t=1740406754\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pi, die, and try again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Easy as Pi</i> you might die a lot,\u00a0but that just means you're learning! Explore 4 different areas with unique mechanics<i>,</i>\u00a0and collect hard-to-reach P.I.E.S. throughout your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536140/extras/piTrail.png?t=1740406754\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Movement: Arrow keys;\u00a0WASD; Controller joystick/D-Pad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Quick Restart: R; Right trigger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Return to menu: Z; Left trigger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Fullscreen: F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Game auto-saves\u00a0upon room entry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Note: Joystick not recommended.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Some features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 60 fast but very difficult levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 10 collectible P.I.E.S.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\u00a0\u00a0A special Finale level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- An OST with 6 songs(Including\u00a0<i>Aeternum</i> and\u00a0<i>Impossibly Irrational</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Speed-running potential!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536140?t=1740406754","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/im